---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"
import { url } from "../lib/url"
---

<BaseLayout title="页面走丢了" description="没有找到这个页面，回到画廊继续逛。" noindex>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap center-stage" style="min-height:78svh;padding-block:var(--s-9)">
      <p class="eyebrow">NAILONG GALLERY · 404</p>
      <h1
        class="hero__title"
        style="font-size:clamp(4rem,18vw,12rem);margin:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--c-yellow),var(--c-green));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;filter:drop-shadow(0 6px 30px rgb(255 213 79 / 0.3))"
      >
        404
      </h1>
      <p style="color:var(--c-text-dim);max-width:42ch;font-size:var(--fs-lg)">
        这一格还空着——奶龙也许正叼着画笔，去别的展厅补色了。
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--s-3);justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href={url("/gallery/")}>回到画廊</a>
        <a class="btn" href={url("/")}>返回首页</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
